:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser []
<<effects>>
<<set $location to "tower">>
<<set $moor to 100>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Soon you see the castle again. Your <<beasttype>> arrives first, and <<bHe 1>> lets out a terrifying screech to warn off the intruder circling nearby.
    <br><br>
    Whatever this <<beasttype>> intended, <<bHe 0>> has missed the chance now. You land in the nest, shelter your children under your wings, and keep a close eye on <<bHe 0>>'s every move.
    <br>
    The moment you land, <<your_bird_text>> rushes at the intruder. <<bHe 1>> dives at high speed, and the intruder immediately turns to try to shake off <<bhis 1>> pursuit.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    很快，你就再次看见了城堡。你的<<beasttype>>先一步到达，<<bHe 1>>发出一声骇人的尖啸，警告在附近盘旋的外来者。
    <br><br>
    无论这只<<beasttype>>想做什么，<<bHe 0>>现在都错失了机会。你降落在巢里，把你的孩子护在翅膀下，紧盯着<<bHe 0>>的一举一动。
    <br>
    你一降落，<<your_bird_text>>就猛地冲向外来者。<<bHe 1>>在空中高速俯冲，而外来者立刻调转方向，试图摆脱<<bhis 1>>的追击。
<</language>>
<<= $monster ? lanSwitch("they","他") : lanSwitch("they","它")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    tumble and tangle in the air, moving so fast it makes you dizzy.
    <br>
    After an almost vertical turn, the foreign <<beasttype>> pulls away from your mate. <<bHe 0>> rolls over in midair and comes flying straight toward you!
  <<option 'CN'>>
    们在空中翻飞纠缠，速度快得令你眼花缭乱。
    <br>
    一个近乎垂直的急转后，外来的<<beasttype>>与你的配偶拉开距离，<<bHe 0>>在空中翻身，直直冲着你的方向飞来！
<</language>>
<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<bHe 0>>'s eyes show pure, wild hunger. Your scalp prickles.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<bHe 0>>的眼中透露出纯粹野性的饥饿。你感到头皮发麻。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Defend", "防御"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 2">>
  <<set $phase to 1>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Strike back", "迎击"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 2">>
  <<set $phase to 2>>
<</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 2 []
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tense your whole body and spread your wings to block the attack, but the <<beasttype>> streaks past in front of you and snatches... a lurker from your pile of spoils?
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你全身绷紧，张开翅膀抵御袭击，但<<beasttype>>飞速穿梭着经过你的面前，抓走了战利品堆里的……一只潜伏者？
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You brace yourself, and when the <<beasttype>> streaks past you, you lunge at <<bhim 0>>. <<bHe 0>> dodges you in a panic, grabs a lurker from your pile of spoils, and leaps down from the tower.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你做好准备，在<<beasttype>>穿梭着经过你时猛地扑向<<bhim 0>>。<<bHe 0>>慌忙避开你，抓住你战利品堆里的一只潜伏者便跃向塔下。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Weighed down by the lurker, <<bHe 0>> is hampered in climbing again. <<your_bird_text "cap">> seizes the opening and cuts the intruder off, bearing <<bhim 0>> down toward the ground.
    Amid a great flurry of feathers scattered through the air, the sound of <<beastsplural>> wings beating against each other fades into the distance.
    <br>
    Only now do you have time to check on your children,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    由于那只潜伏者的影响，<<bHe 0>>再次攀升时受到了阻碍。<<your_bird_text "cap">>抓住这个破绽，成功截住了外来者，带着<<bhim 0>>一起俯冲向地面。
    伴随着一大片散落在空中的羽毛，<<beastsplural>>翅膀互相扑打拍击的声音逐渐远去。
    <br>
    你这时才有空查看你的孩子，
<</language>>
<<set _fledgling_ids to maplebirch.get('BirdTower').at('tower')
  .filter(child => ["Nestling", "Hatchling"].includes(child.development.stage))
  .map(child => child.childId)>>
<<set _multi to _fledgling_ids.length-1>>
<<childSelect _fledgling_ids[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<childrenNames _fledgling_ids>> are huddled, shivering, in
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<childrenNames _fledgling_ids>>正瑟瑟发抖地缩在
<</language>>
<<= $phase is 1 ? lanSwitch("your arms","你的怀里") : lanSwitch("the nest","巢里")>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    ,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    ，
<</language>>
<<= _multi ? lanSwitch("They","他们") : "<<childhim>>">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    and look only startled, not injured.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    看起来只是受了些惊吓，但没有受伤。
<</language>>
<<lstress>><<stress -5>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    After soothing
  <<option 'CN'>>
    安抚好
<</language>>
<<= _multi ? lanSwitch("children","孩子们") : "<<childname>>">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    , your Great Hawk has not yet returned to the tower. You look down to the base and see <<your_bird_text>> pinning the intruder down, <<bhe 1>> savagely plucking out the other's feathers with their talons.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    ，你的巨鹰还没有回到高塔上来。你向塔底望去，只看到<<your_bird_text>>压制着外来者，<<bhe 1>>正用爪子狠狠地拔下对方的羽毛。
<</language>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Descend to the base of the tower", "降落到塔底"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 3">><</lanLink>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 3 []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You land nearby and walk over, watching the scuffle as you go.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你降落在附近，一边围观着这场扭打一边走了过去。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "How, dare, you. Come to my tower, threaten my children?" The Great Hawk grips the intruder hard, <<bHe 1>>'s feathers bristling with agitation, and <<bHe 1>> still seems to be in a fury.
      <br>
      The intruder struggles without a word, still clutching the lurker in <<bHis 0>> talons. The Great Hawk pins <<bhim 0>> down and plucks another tuft of feathers. "Let go of my prey, and get out."
      <br><br>
      You step forward, wanting to know why a <<beasttype>> would try to enter another harpy's territory, especially when you are brooding.
      <br>
      Unexpectedly, <<bhe 0>> reacts fiercely to your question: "I have my own children to feed. You hoard the tower and pile up so much prey—" <<bhe 0>> does not get to finish; the Great Hawk presses <<bhe 0>>'s head into the dirt with their talons.
      <br>
      "Failing to catch prey is your incompetence. Failing to take the tower is your weakness. Now get out."
      <br>
      There is the faintest trace of sorrow in <<bhe 1>>'s tone. <<bHe 1>> releases the other <<beasttype>>, who immediately grabs the lurker and flies off unsteadily.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "你、怎么、敢。来我的塔，威胁我的孩子？"巨鹰用力地抓着外来者，<<bHe 1>>身上的羽毛激动地竖起，看起来<<bHe 1>>仍处在愤怒之中。
      <br>
      外来者不发一言地挣扎着，<<bHis 0>>的爪子里仍紧紧抓着那只潜伏者。巨鹰按住<<bhim 0>>，再次拔下了一撮羽毛。"放开我的猎物，然后滚出去。"
      <br><br>
      你走上前，想知道为什么一只<<beasttype>>会试图进入其他哈比的领地，特别是考虑到你们正在育雏。
      <br>
      出乎意料的是，<<bhe 0>>对你的问题反应激烈："我有我自己的孩子要喂养。你独占了塔，还堆积那么多猎物——"<<bhe 0>>没能说完，巨鹰用爪子将<<bhe 0>>的头按进了土里。
      <br>
      "抓不到猎物，是你无能。抢不走塔，是你太弱。现在滚吧。"
      <br>
      <<bhe 1>>的语气中有非常细微的一丝悲伤。<<bHe 1>>放开了另一个<<beasttype>>，对方立刻抓起潜伏者，摇摇晃晃地飞走了。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Your Great Hawk screeches at the intruder, trying to make <<bhim 0>> let go of the prey that belongs to you.
      <<bHe 0>> struggles violently, but soon loses strength, still clutching the lurker tightly in their talons.
      <br><br>
      You step forward, wanting to know why a <<beasttype>> would try to enter another harpy's territory, especially when you are brooding.
      <br>
      The <<beasttype>> screeches back in fury and is roughly pinned down by your Great Hawk. Given that you hold the tower and have piled up quite a few lurkers inside, <<bhe 0>> was probably after food.
      <br>
      After a long stalemate, the ground is covered in the intruder's fallen feathers. The Great Hawk lets out a victorious screech and drives the intruder away, and the intruder immediately grabs the lurker and flies off unsteadily.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的巨鹰冲着入侵者尖鸣，试图让<<bhim 0>>放开属于你们的猎物。
      <<bHe 0>>剧烈地挣扎着，但很快失去了力气，爪子却依然紧紧抓着潜伏者。
      <br><br>
      你走上前，想知道为什么一只<<beasttype>>会试图进入其他哈比的领地，特别是你们正在育雏。
      <br>
      <<beasttype>>愤怒地尖啸回应，被你的巨鹰狠狠按住。考虑到你们占领了高塔，还在塔里堆积了不少潜伏者，<<bhe 0>>可能是冲着食物来的。
      <br>
      一段僵持争斗后，地面上铺满了入侵者落下的羽毛。巨鹰发出一声胜利的尖鸣，驱赶外来者让对方离开，而外来者立刻抓起潜伏者，摇摇晃晃地飞走了。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set $bird.materials.lurkers -= 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You stand at <<your_bird_text>>'s side and check <<bHe 1>>'s injuries. <span class="green">You are quite sure the intruder did not do much damage</span>.
    <<your_bird_text "cap">>'s feathers lie flat and dejected,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你站到<<your_bird_text>>的身边，查看<<bHe 1>>的伤势。<span class="green">你很确定外来者没有造成多大损伤</span>。
    <<your_bird_text "cap">>的羽毛沮丧地贴在身上，
<</language>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe 1>> lowers their head in shame. "I'm sorry, <<wife>>..." <<bHe 1>> says, "I failed to protect our children, and I lost the prey too."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe 1>>羞愧地低下头。"对不起，<<wife>>……"<<bHe 1>>说，"没能保护好我们的孩子，还丢了猎物。"
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe 1>> chirps softly, seemingly dejected at having failed to protect your children.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe 1>>低声喳喳叫，似乎正为没能保护好你们的孩子而沮丧。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Comfort", "安抚"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 4">>
  <<set $phase to 1>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love 1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom 1>>
<</lanLink>>
<<glove>><<gdom>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Scold", "斥责"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 4">>
  <<set $phase to 2>>
  <<npcincr "Great Hawk" love -1>><<npcincr "Great Hawk" dom -3>>
<</lanLink>>
<<llove>><<lldom>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Trespasser 4 []
<<effects>>
<<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $bird.hunts.duo to false>>
<<set $bird.timer to 30>>
<<set $bird.state to "hunting">>
<<if $phase is 1>>
  <<switch $speech_attitude>>
    <<case "bratty">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You pat <<bhim 1>> on the back and soothe <<bhim 1>>: "Don't worry, the chicks weren't hurt, and it's just one lurker. We have plenty at home."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你拍拍<<bhim 1>>的后背，安抚<<bhim 1>>："别担心，小鹰也没有受伤，一只潜伏者而已，家里多的是呢。"
      <</language>>
    <<case "meek">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Y-you did well, our children weren't hurt," you stroke <<bhim 1>> gently, "and besides, <<bhe 0>> really did seem to need that lurker..."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "你、你做得很好，我们的孩子没有受伤，"你轻柔地抚摸着<<bhim 1>>，"而且，<<bhe 0>>看起来确实很需要那只潜伏者……"
      <</language>>
    <<case "neutral">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "This isn't your fault." You soothe <<bhim 1>>. "Besides, <<bhe 0>> didn't hurt our children either. You successfully stopped <<bhim 0>>."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "这不是你的错。"你安抚着<<bhim 1>>，"况且，<<bhe 0>>也没有伤到我们的孩子。你成功阻止了<<bhim 0>>。"
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Thank you, <<wife>>." <<bHe 1>> looks grateful.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "谢谢你，<<wife>>。"<<bHe 1>>看起来很感激。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe 1>> chirps softly and nuzzles you happily.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe 1>>轻声唧唧叫，开心地轻蹭你。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<<else>>
  <<switch $speech_attitude>>
    <<case "bratty">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "You <<beasttype>> really are terrifying when you go mad," you kick aside the feathers underfoot. "Leaving the chicks alone in the tower really is too dangerous."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "你们<<beasttype>>疯起来是真的挺吓人的，"你踢开脚下的羽毛，"把小鹰单独留在塔里确实太危险了。"
      <</language>>
    <<case "meek">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "I-it really was dangerous," you say, shaken by how close the <<beasttype>> came to your children. "If we hadn't arrived in time..."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "真、真的很危险，"你后怕于<<beasttype>>与你的孩子有多近，"要不是我们及时赶到……"
      <</language>>
    <<case "neutral">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "We shouldn't leave the children alone in the tower," you sigh. "It's too dangerous."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          "我们不应该把孩子单独留在塔里的，"你叹气，"太危险了。"
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $monster is 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "<<Wife>> is right," <<bHe 1>> looks even more ashamed.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "<<Wife>>说的对，"<<bHe 1>>看起来更羞愧了。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<bHe 1>> flinches at your words.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<bHe 1>>因你的话瑟缩。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<if $monster is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "We must make sure no one dares come into our territory." <<bHe 1>> looks into the distance and spreads their wings, soaring high. <<bHe 1>> circles higher than usual, screeching loudly to proclaim their presence.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      "必须要保证没人敢来我们的领地。"<<bHe 1>>看向远方，展翅飞向高空。<<bHe 1>>在比平时更高的高空盘旋着，高声尖啸着宣扬自己的存在。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<bHe 1>> looks into the distance and spreads their wings, soaring high. <<your_bird_text "cap">> flies higher than usual, and <<bHe 1>> circles and screeches loudly, marking this territory as their own to everything living in the moor.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<bHe 1>>看向远方，展翅飞向高空。<<your_bird_text "cap">>飞得比平时更高，<<bHe 1>>盘旋着，高声尖啸，向荒原的一切生物标记这片领地属于自己。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<your_bird_text "cap">> gradually flies farther out, patrolling along the borders of the territory.
    <br><br>
    You return to the tower and keep your children company until <<bhe 1>> comes back.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<your_bird_text "cap">>逐渐向更远方飞去，沿着领地的边界巡逻。
    <br><br>
    你回到高塔上，在<<bhe 1>>回来之前陪伴着你的孩子。
<</language>>
<<set _fledgling_ids to maplebirch.get('BirdTower').at('tower')
  .filter(child => ["Nestling", "Hatchling"].includes(child.development.stage))
  .map(child => child.childId)>>
<<set _multi to _fledgling_ids.length-1>>
<<childSelect _fledgling_ids[0]>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You hold <<childrenNames _fledgling_ids>> in your arms,
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你把<<childrenNames _fledgling_ids>>抱在怀里，
<</language>>
<<= _multi ? lanSwitch("They","他们") : "<<childhim>>">>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    and they snuggle against you, relaxed, chirping softly.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    放松地依偎着你，发出轻柔的唧唧声。
<</language>>
<<lstress>><<stress -5>>
<br>
<<switch $bird.upgrades.decor>>
  <<case 1>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        After some fixing up, the tower is very cozy and warm.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        经过一番修整，高塔变得十分舒适温馨。
    <</language>>
    <<stress -6>><<lstress>>
  <<case 2>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your hunting spoils make you feel truly home.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的狩猎战利品让你感到自己真的回到了家。
    <</language>>
    <<stress -12>><<llstress>>
  <<case 3>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your hunting spoils make you feel truly home.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的狩猎战利品让你感到自己真的回到了家。
    <</language>>
    <<stress -24>><<lllstress>>
  <<case 4>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Home at last.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        终于回家了。
    <</language>>
    <<stress -36>><<trauma -6>><<lllstress>><<ltrauma>>
  <<case 5>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Home at last. The silver bars
      <<option 'CN'>>
        终于回家了。银条
    <</language>>
    <<if Time.dayState is "night">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          gently reflect the tranquil moonlight.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          温柔地反射着宁静的月光。
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          cast tranquil reflections across your tower.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          在你的塔上洒下宁静的倒影。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
    <<set $stress to 0>>
    <<trauma -6>><<lllstress>><<ltrauma>>
  <<default>>
<</switch>>
<br>
<<if $bird.hunts.lootAmount is 0>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You did not bring anything else back, but that is all right.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你没有带回其它东西，但这并没有关系。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<flight_hunt_end>>
  <<lanLink ["Continue", "继续"] "Bird Tower">>
    <<endevent>>
  <</lanLink>>
  <br>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You sort through what you brought back from hunting earlier.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你把你们之前狩猎带回来的东西整理起来。
  <</language>>
  <br>
  <<flight_hunt_loot>>
<</if>>
